{"text": "\u201cTo be eligible for product mailings, certified 21+ smokers must be affirmatively age\nverified as 21 years of age or older. There are three forms of age verification that FUR.\nwill accept:\n\nIndependent third-party verification\n4 Sight verification\nPhotocopy verification\n\n\u2018The following procedures cover the photocopy verification process. These procedures\nare part of our ongoing efforts to restrict underage smoking. The procedures must be\nstrictly adhered to at all times without exception.\n\n\u00abSmokers must complete and retum to RJR an age verification form as well as a\nphotocopy of their offical identification (see attached).\n\n\u00a9 The name on the form must reasonably match the name on the ID:\n\u2014 Generally accepted nickname differences like Robert and Bob are okay.\n~ If the first name on the form is the first or middle name on the ID it is okay.\n~ Last names should closely match allowing for a misspelling on the ID.\n\n\u2018\u00a2 The address on the form must reasonably match the address on the ID.\n\u00a9 The birth date on the form must match the birth date on the ID.\n\n\u00a9 If there is a question, suspend the piece and send it to Consumer Relations for\nreview.\n\n* Ifthe photocopy is not sufficiently clear to read the information, suspend the piece\nand send to Consumer Relations.\n\n+ An ID that appears to have been tampered with should not be accepted.*\n\u00a9 The ID must not be expired.\n\n\u00a9 The ID must be some form of official identification that contains all of the following\ninformation:\n- Nome\n\u2014 Address\n= Date of Birth\n\nL9vs LSSTS\n\n* = Altering an official 1D probably constitutes a violation of law in addltion to constituting a constitutive\nofmail fraud.", "words": [{"text": "\u201cTo", "x0": 103, "y0": 122, "x1": 119, "y1": 134, "conf": 62.0}, {"text": "be", "x0": 124, "y0": 122, "x1": 137, "y1": 134, "conf": 89.0}, {"text": "eligible", "x0": 141, "y0": 122, "x1": 184, "y1": 137, "conf":